    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/5718640ab5f8b33ac75b815559054778.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/5718640ab5f8b33ac75b815559054778.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/5718640ab5f8b33ac75b815559054778.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;The Heart of Influencer&gt; is a first-person live-action interactive narrative game. You have been entrusted with training five &quot;troubled&quot; female influencers from Mountain &amp; Sea Media. Through a deal with Xiubi, you gain the \u201cHeart Probe\u201d ability which allows you to probe into girls\u2019 inner thoughts. Use your wisdom and ability to help the influencers meet their training KPIs, while probe into their hidden selves beneath their facades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Introduction of Main character:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanfan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute-style influencer hitting a career plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/abec0c18bcab0801036cba927b94b9d1.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/abec0c18bcab0801036cba927b94b9d1.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/abec0c18bcab0801036cba927b94b9d1.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yiduo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dance influencer with a bold and uninhibited personality, who seems less dedicated to her work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/0ec621c7477f9e2d382204ea3f6dce17.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/0ec621c7477f9e2d382204ea3f6dce17.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/0ec621c7477f9e2d382204ea3f6dce17.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popular Lawmage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A law popularizing influencer who loves to tell jokes, good ones and bad ones, and hasn\u2019t forgotten an old \u201cgrudge\u201d against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/b87fa69d0b36e5d8e8781767a341050b.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/b87fa69d0b36e5d8e8781767a341050b.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/b87fa69d0b36e5d8e8781767a341050b.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuckTakesLicksinLakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A looks-based influencer with a not-particularly-outstanding look, who refuses to \u201cplay the curvy card\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/fa97782ce899af823deb0cd47fc7a0d1.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/fa97782ce899af823deb0cd47fc7a0d1.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/fa97782ce899af823deb0cd47fc7a0d1.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FliesFlyFromFlames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chitchat influencer notorious for giving fans \u201clousy idea\u201d, self-described as &quot;an aimless deadbeat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/957499cc2b5a7d833fe527fb1250227f.poster.avif?t=1745804800\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/957499cc2b5a7d833fe527fb1250227f.webm?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562530/extras/957499cc2b5a7d833fe527fb1250227f.mp4?t=1745804800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Game Features:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-Driven Narrative: Every decision you make shapes the story's direction and outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart Probe Mechanic: You can uncover the girls\u2019 true feelings by probe into their hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings: Ten different branching story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map-like Storyline: The player can freely navigate between different characters\u2019 storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>About Us</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Mountain &amp; Sea Studio, dedicated to crafting live-action interactive movie games. Our representative work is &quot;Underworld Island&quot; \u3001 \u201cSuperscout\u201d and\u00a0\u201cSovereign Brain Empire\u201d  . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telling good stories with heart and soul, making great games with dedication, is our original aspiration.</p>",
