ryline: The player can freely navigate between different characters\u2019 storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>About Us</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Mountain &amp; Sea Studio, dedicated to crafting live-action interactive movie games. Our representative work is &quot;Underworld Island&quot; \u3001 \u201cSuperscout\u201d and\u00a0\u201cSovereign Brain Empire\u201d  . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Telling good stories with heart and soul, making great games with dedication, is our original aspiration.</p>",
